{
 "name": "r2_06_device_app_lifecycle",
 "steps": [
  {
   "note": "目的：背夹总览管理一个新建我的创作副本。执行前基线必须与本轮目录一致：18项、mine仅skill:小家；不存在r2_device_demo。安装后19项、验收包为mine最后项。主会话必须先核对前置；执行器不会因 expect 失败自动停止，前置不符禁止继续本场景。任何菜单标题不是R2Device均停止。"
  },
  {
   "note": "【执行适配】手机侧改用 phone_ui.py install/appact/field/tapexact（按真实控件文字和应用卡片定位；原脚本按 'Lua'/'应用 ID' 等精确文字找不到控件，标签页会横向滚动）。串口不再复位背夹，手机连接保持。 焦点：按 apps_all 分组顺序算出目标序号后按 ▶，截图核对。"
  },
  {
   "note": "前置：小米 M610BB 手机 App 在设备页、无弹窗；扫描按钮可见。仅重连测试背夹，保持现有正常 AI 配置。串口复位后必须在本场景内重连；失败立即停止本场景。"
  },
  {
   "shell": "python3 phone_ui.py connect",
   "gate": true,
   "timeout_ms": 90000
  },
  {
   "op": "mode_set",
   "mode": "clip"
  },
  {
   "op": "mode_get",
   "expect": {
    "mode": "clip",
    "phone_linked": true,
    "voice_route": "ble"
   },
   "gate": true
  },
  {
   "note": "仅安装新验收副本 r2_device_demo，执行前只读确认 ID 不存在；不可替换已有包。Lua 使用手机内置贪吃蛇示例。手机处于连接成功的设备页。主会话保存安装完成的手机截图，目录字段必须 group=mine/removable=true。"
  },
  {
   "op": "apps_all",
   "expect_not_contains": {
    "apps": "r2_device_demo"
   },
   "gate": true
  },
  {
   "shell": "python3 phone_ui.py install r2_device_demo R2Device",
   "timeout_ms": 120000,
   "gate": true
  },
  {
   "wait": 12000
  },
  {
   "op": "apps_all",
   "expect_contains": {
    "apps": "r2_device_demo"
   },
   "gate": true
  },
  {
   "shell": "python3 phone_ui.py dump"
  },
  {
   "op": "ui_key",
   "key": "SET",
   "action": "click"
  },
  {
   "wait": 1000
  },
  {
   "op": "home_state",
   "expect": {
    "view": "overview"
   }
  },
  {
   "overview_focus": "r2_device_demo"
  },
  {
   "wait": 800
  },
  {
   "shot": "fixture_focus_verify"
  },
  {
   "op": "home_state",
   "expect": {
    "view": "overview"
   },
   "expect_contains": {
    "ov_focus": "r2_device_demo"
   },
   "gate": true
  },
  {
   "note": "主会话确认焦点是新增R2Device才继续；源码按分组遍历，包预期最后。不是目标立即停止，禁止对既有小家操作。"
  },
  {
   "op": "ui_key",
   "key": "MODE",
   "action": "long",
   "ms": 900
  },
  {
   "wait": 1000
  },
  {
   "op": "home_state",
   "expect": {
    "view": "sheet"
   },
   "expect_contains": {
    "target": "r2_device_demo"
   },
   "gate": true
  },
  {
   "shot": "fixture_menu"
  },
  {
   "op": "ui_key",
   "key": "VOLUME_UP",
   "action": "click"
  },
  {
   "op": "ui_key",
   "key": "VOLUME_UP",
   "action": "click"
  },
  {
   "op": "ui_key",
   "key": "MODE",
   "action": "click"
  },
  {
   "wait": 1000
  },
  {
   "op": "home_state",
   "expect": {
    "view": "rename"
   },
   "expect_contains": {
    "target": "r2_device_demo"
   },
   "gate": true
  },
  {
   "shot": "device_keyboard_before"
  },
  {
   "note": "480×800源码键盘在y444–744，默认小写第一行q键中心约(62,481)。先检查本张图再执行，输入一个q追加到原名。若本候选布局不同由主会话正常触摸键盘并记录实际坐标，不准协议改名代替。"
  },
  {
   "op": "ui_touch",
   "type": "tap",
   "x": 62,
   "y": 481,
   "ms": 90
  },
  {
   "wait": 400
  },
  {
   "op": "ui_key",
   "key": "MODE",
   "action": "click"
  },
  {
   "wait": 2000
  },
  {
   "op": "apps_all",
   "expect_contains": {
    "apps": "R2Deviceq"
   }
  },
  {
   "shot": "renamed_overview"
  },
  {
   "note": "进入刚才焦点菜单，验证取消卸载保留，再确认卸载。每步主会话复核标题为R2Deviceq。"
  },
  {
   "op": "ui_key",
   "key": "MODE",
   "action": "long",
   "ms": 900
  },
  {
   "wait": 1000
  },
  {
   "op": "home_state",
   "expect": {
    "view": "sheet"
   },
   "expect_contains": {
    "target": "r2_device_demo"
   },
   "gate": true
  },
  {
   "op": "ui_key",
   "key": "VOLUME_UP",
   "action": "click"
  },
  {
   "op": "ui_key",
   "key": "VOLUME_UP",
   "action": "click"
  },
  {
   "op": "ui_key",
   "key": "VOLUME_UP",
   "action": "click"
  },
  {
   "op": "ui_key",
   "key": "MODE",
   "action": "click"
  },
  {
   "wait": 1000
  },
  {
   "op": "home_state",
   "expect": {
    "view": "confirm"
   },
   "expect_contains": {
    "target": "r2_device_demo"
   },
   "gate": true
  },
  {
   "shot": "uninstall_confirmation"
  },
  {
   "op": "ui_key",
   "key": "SET",
   "action": "click"
  },
  {
   "wait": 1000
  },
  {
   "op": "apps_all",
   "expect_contains": {
    "apps": "R2Deviceq"
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "ui_key",
   "key": "MODE",
   "action": "long",
   "ms": 900
  },
  {
   "wait": 1000
  },
  {
   "op": "ui_key",
   "key": "VOLUME_UP",
   "action": "click"
  },
  {
   "op": "ui_key",
   "key": "VOLUME_UP",
   "action": "click"
  },
  {
   "op": "ui_key",
   "key": "VOLUME_UP",
   "action": "click"
  },
  {
   "op": "ui_key",
   "key": "MODE",
   "action": "click"
  },
  {
   "wait": 1000
  },
  {
   "op": "home_state",
   "expect": {
    "view": "confirm"
   },
   "expect_contains": {
    "target": "r2_device_demo"
   },
   "gate": true
  },
  {
   "op": "ui_key",
   "key": "VOLUME_UP",
   "action": "click"
  },
  {
   "op": "ui_key",
   "key": "MODE",
   "action": "click"
  },
  {
   "wait": 2500
  },
  {
   "op": "apps_all"
  },
  {
   "shot": "after_device_uninstall"
  },
  {
   "note": "按ID确认app:r2_device_demo消失、既有skill:小家与其他应用仍在。手机刷新后也应消失。主会话保存手机列表截图。"
  },
  {
   "shell": "python3 phone_ui.py tab 应用 && python3 phone_ui.py top && python3 phone_ui.py tapexact 刷新列表",
   "timeout_ms": 60000
  },
  {
   "shell": "python3 phone_ui.py dump"
  },
  {
   "op": "ui_key",
   "key": "SET",
   "action": "click"
  },
  {
   "wait": 1000
  },
  {
   "op": "home_state",
   "expect": {
    "view": "home"
   }
  },
  {
   "phone_shot": "phone_after_device_uninstall"
  },
  {
   "shell": "python3 phone_ui.py tab 设备"
  }
 ]
}